@@ -29,6 +29,16 @@ applyPatch({ users: ['Ada'] }, [{ op: 'add', path: '/users/-', value: 'Lin' }]);
 // { users: ['Ada', 'Lin'] }
 ```
 
+`createPatch(from, to)` creates a granular RFC 6902 patch for synchronizing two JSON documents. It
+does not mutate either document; unchanged members and array elements are omitted from the result.
+
+```ts
+import { createPatch } from 'json-toolkit';
+
+createPatch({ profile: { name: 'Ada', role: 'admin' } }, { profile: { name: 'Ada', role: 'user' } });
+// [{ op: 'replace', path: '/profile/role', value: 'user' }]
+```
+
 ## JSON Merge Patch
 
 `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
